# [SAVNET](../wg/savnet.html)

## Summary

The SAVNET working group met at IETF 127 to review progress on its core architectural drafts, receive updates on proposed intra-domain and inter-domain solution approaches, and discuss SAV monitoring mechanisms using IPFIX as well as working group terminology. Key topics included updates to the inter-domain and intra-domain architecture specifications, solution proposals (IntraSAV and Bicone), vendor implementation experience exporting SAV telemetry via IPFIX, and how best to manage SAV terminology across working group documents.

## Key Discussion Points

